            "text": "Raster-record presence is paint ownership, not an optional optimization. Returning for both proved-empty and warned-unmaterialized records prevents the pre-DM-2456 failure path from silently substituting a platform-sampled form control, while controls with no raster record remain on the author-owned vector path. See also src/capture/native-control-raster.ts.",
