          "message": {
            "text": "The select-arrow overlay occupies Blink's exact box-decoration phase: pinned BoxFragmentPainter paints CSS background, then ThemePainter::PaintDecorations, then inset shadow and border; selected text follows as content. The focused composition unit asserts this order, while closed-shadow input parts retain their later content slot.",
